        "tag": "migration-final-20260821",
        "message": "corpus-legislation-nz migration final state\n\nFinal operational donor commit:\nb40587f1b1aec7356a0f623916fcc8212397d283\n\nOperational work moved to edithatogo/archive-govt-nz. This annotated tag marks\nthe frozen donor source state committed on 2026-08-21; it does not rewrite the\ncommit, publish a dataset, alter an existing DOI, or claim that all referenced\nsource content is relicensed.\n\nExisting public identities remain:\n- Hugging Face: edithatogo/corpus-legislation-nz\n- Hugging Face historical: edithatogo/corpus-legislation-nz-historical\n- Zenodo concept DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.20592539\n- Zenodo 2026 version DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.20592540\n\nThe independent edithatogo/legislation product remains separate and untouched.\nSee the Prompt 19 verification receipt in edithatogo/archive-govt-nz before\nusing any preservation bundle.\n"
