        "published_at": "2026-09-03T09:14:15Z",
        "body": "Public preservation release for the archived `edithatogo/corpus-legislation-nz` donor.\n\nThe attached Git bundle preserves the verified donor Git graph at operational head `b40587f1b1aec7356a0f623916fcc8212397d283`. Verify the asset SHA-256 before use:\n\n`f125f91b06264a97e59f65fac47878a74d646c915f12c0b05841c1550ec741c2`\n\nThe donor's annotated tag `migration-final-20260821` points to that operational commit. The donor's current `main` contains only the later archival redirect presentation.\n\nThe public durable dataset package is held at Hugging Face revision [`ae4da4ef0446f68fddd8f53279ecb1245f1529b9`](https://huggingface.co/datasets/edithatogo/corpus-legislation-nz/commit/ae4da4ef0446f68fddd8f53279ecb1245f1529b9), separately from this Git-history bundle.\n\nThis release preserves repository history. It does not relicense source content or establish complete legislative coverage.\n",
